{{#each confidential.matters}}
### {{name}}
- Read in: {{join read_in ", "}}. **Not read in: {{join not_read_in ", "}}.**
- Never put {{name}} material (or these terms: {{join keywords ", "}}) into: web searches or web fetches; calendar invites or event titles; drafts or docs that anyone not read in can see; any third-party tool or API (including enrichment and embeddings).
